{"agent": "edit", "file": "src/useShortcuts.js", "old": "// Whether a key lands somewhere the person types: an input, a textarea or\n// an editable block.\nfunction isTyping(target) {\n  const tag = (target.tagName || \"\").toLowerCase();\n  return tag === \"input\" || tag === \"textarea\" || EDITABLE.has(target.contentEditable);\n}", "new": "// Whether a key lands somewhere the person types: an input, a textarea or\n// anything inside an editable block, so the closest editable ancestor counts.\nfunction isTyping(target) {\n  for (let node = target; node; node = node.parentNode) {\n    const tag = (node.tagName || \"\").toLowerCase();\n    if (tag === \"input\" || tag === \"textarea\" || EDITABLE.has(node.contentEditable)) return true;\n  }\n  return false;\n}", "after": 2, "takes": 1.5, "say": "The failing test types inside a span within a note, so the target itself isn't marked editable. I'll check the closest editable ancestor instead."}
